<title>POLAND: Wedel surges 9.9 pct before earnings data.</title>
<headline>Wedel surges 9.9 pct before earnings data.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish confectioner E.Wedel Zaklady Przemyslu Cukierniczego SA (Wedel) surged 9.9 percent in active trade on Wednesday on speculation the firm would record good September earnings later this week, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Apparently some investors think Wedel will record good results&quot;, one trader said about the firm whose stock closed at 182.5 zlotys.</p>
<p>Polish listed firms will release their September results by the end of the week.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
